        "axes": "+Y barrel (along the hand, ahead in the hold), +Z weapon top (up in the IdleArmed / WalkArmed hold: thumb side of the inward-turned grip)"
      },
      "runtime_contract": {
        "clip_names": "looping clips carry a \"-loop\" suffix (Godot imports them as Idle / IdleArmed / Walk / WalkArmed with loop LINEAR); look clips up by both names",
        "armed": "IdleArmed / WalkArmed when the unit holds a one-handed weapon; Attack starts and ends in that hold; attach the weapon to the weapon_r bone (+Y barrel, +Z top)",
        "turn_to_attacker": null,
        "hit": "non-lethal: play Hit<variant> (0.3 s directional recoil; variant from the shot direction relative to the facing, ragdoll.handoff.variant_rule); no turn",
        "death": "user decisions 2026-10-02: play Death<variant> (0.133 s snappy recoil away from the shot; no turn, no crumple); on its last frame start the ragdoll with that variant's velocities (ragdoll.handoff.variants), the ground-clearance lift, a small push along the shot on spine_02 / spine_03 / head, the whole-body twist toward the shooter (ragdoll.handoff.twist_toward_shooter: rigid rotation of all bodies about the vertical, 0 for a frontal shot, full from behind) and the per-death variation; settle-and-freeze with the settle-assist rule; DeathBaked is the no-physics fallback (DeathFront, then falls backward)",
        "blood": "every shot: ray-cast against the visible skinned mesh, a wound decal at the hit point on the hit bone (BoneAttachment3D, cull mask = the unit's own visual layer, capped) with drip runs growing down the surface; the decal carries a dark ragged entry hole (3 variants per wound, random roll per hit, wound_decals.variants); the hit spray starts AT the skin on that hole (emitter spray.runtime.origin_inset_m inside the surface, burst-origin texel on it, billboard pulled depth_pull_m toward the camera) and flies BACK toward the shooter (normalize(-shot + normal), blood.json spray.runtime); at death floor splatter decals; pool under the frozen corpse inside the death tile. No UV0 wound overlay"
      },
      "albedo_policy": "the natural opus-v2 skin bake at the SECTOID.PCK colours; the opus-v3 per-asset darkening is undone (user decision 2026-10-02: modern lighting renders units brighter than the sprites, accepted)",
      "source_assumptions": [
        "Proportions from UP024 row measurements; battlescape PCK is the silhouette/colour authority.",
        "Skin colour = battlescape mauve-brown (PCK mid-tones), the natural opus-v2 bake (no per-asset darkening).",
        "Three digits (two fingers + thumb), three toes; arms shortened so fingertips hang at mid-thigh (user decisions).",
        "Unseen sides inferred from the 8 facings and UP024; no back view exists in UP024.",
        "Idle and Hit are authored (routine 0 has no idle or hit frames).",
        "Armed: rarm1H 232 forearm-forward waist hold in IdleArmed / WalkArmed; Attack raises it to a shoulder aim (user rule).",
        "Walk: 8 sprite phases per gait cycle; the legs cover 2/3 m per cycle, so 3 cycles per straight tile.",
        "Death: a snappy directional recoil (user 2026-10-02) replaces the 264-265 crumple; the ragdoll takes over at 0.133 s and the whole-body twist turns him toward the shooter as he falls; DeathBaked keeps a no-physics fall as fallback.",
        "Blood: green #2f650f from the PCK death frames; wounds at the real impact point (shared tint-neutral wound / drip textures), spray back toward the shooter."
      ],
